Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:05.06,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這是個世界總人口八成左右
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.49,0:00:09.86,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,天生擁有“特異體質·個性”的超人社會
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:14.23,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,為了對抗使用個性進行犯罪的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:17.38,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,“英雄”作為一種職業誕生了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:28.29,MHA.S04.TOP.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,訓練場β
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:28.69,MHA.S04.PASS,,0,0,0,,我們雄英高中1年A班
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:32.33,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,為了通過臨時執照考試 成為職業英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:34.56,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,開始了救助訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:40.10,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,然而 突然發生了原因不明的崩塌事故
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.65,0:00:42.80,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我們受困於地下街
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:46.16,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,嘗試逃出來的我們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:50.51,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,在途中與八百萬同學 以及負傷的飯田同學會合
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.04,0:00:57.80,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,度過重重危機 到達了通往地上的電梯口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:02.97,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,然而 一切還沒有結束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.05,0:01:06.33,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,真正的試煉 現在才剛要開始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.18,0:01:10.83,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,沒錯 從現在開始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.89,0:01:24.36,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}面對一如既往的耀眼光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.36,0:01:27.98,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}你閉上了眼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:31.57,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}沒人留意的陰暗角落裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:35.16,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}隱藏著一束光
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:38.54,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}迷茫 困惑 夢中的瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:42.12,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}縱使淚水劃過臉頰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:45.84,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}希望讓你不再悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:49.34,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}將驚人一鳴獻給你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:55.76,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}將無法改變的過去塗上顏色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:59.97,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}未來定是七彩繽紛 單手拿著調色盤
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:02.02,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}展露笑顏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:05.40,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}這是我一直以來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.40,0:02:07.32,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}僅有的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:10.40,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}跨過最糟糕的夜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:14.36,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}所見無虛 沒有誤會 不會弄錯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:18.20,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}為了能真心地微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:21.58,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}我的祈禱並非僅此一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:24.87,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}也並非轉瞬即逝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:28.42,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}相信定會改變 再度起飛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:36.01,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.18}將你逐漸縮小的視野 將我的世界拓寬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.01,0:02:46.02,MHA.S04.TITLE,,0,0,0,,活下去!\N{\fs20}\N {\fs60}殊死的生存訓練\N{\fs45}\N {\fs60}後篇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:50.17,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,陽光照進來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.97,0:02:52.47,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,能從這裡逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:54.59,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,從這裡就能回到地上了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.33,0:02:58.20,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,看建築構造圖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:03:01.41,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,電梯最多只能到地下1層
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.71,0:03:03.57,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,那為什麼會有光
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:05.51,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,恐怕是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.03,0:03:11.04,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,地上的部分也發生崩塌 所以陽光才照進來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.97,0:03:14.39,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,那樣正好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:15.17,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:19.78,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,有御茶子的個性 這樣就能回到地面了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.19,0:03:22.56,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,好 那就讓大家飄起來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:23.75,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,等一下 麗日同學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.73,0:03:29.35,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,八百萬同學 你到地下1層後 能把繩梯放下來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:31.08,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:33.91,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,綠谷 你要留下來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.16,0:03:35.94,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,留下來 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:39.35,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,班上的大家也許還沒離開
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:42.34,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,也可能像飯田同學一樣受了傷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:46.56,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我要確認大家平安無事 帶他們來這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:50.30,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,八百萬同學 你們就先送飯田同學避難
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:52.32,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:02.46,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,八百萬同學 還要麻煩你向老師們報告情況
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.77,0:04:04.23,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,好 我一定會
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:06.66,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你要當心喔 綠谷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:09.61,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,出久同學 要是遇到危險
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.61,0:04:12.33,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我明白 我會馬上避難
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:19.30,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:24.57,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,轟 為什麼緊急照明亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:30.80,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,應該是有人修好了緊急用電
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:32.69,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,傳送電力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:34.23,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,是上鳴嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:37.20,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,應該是有人讓上鳴這麼做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:41.72,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,頭腦這麼機靈的傢伙 應該是綠谷和八百萬
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.27,0:04:44.76,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,還有一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:46.50,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,爆豪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:49.78,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我找到了 待救援者假人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.90,0:04:51.67,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,幹得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:55.61,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你這個臭市民 給我們添了多少麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:57.23,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,回頭我要宰了你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:58.53,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,宰了假人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.91,0:05:01.06,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,但是 要怎麼挖出來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:03.53,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,硬拉出一個萬一又發生崩塌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:05.47,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我們也會被活埋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:07.25,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你說呢 爆豪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:09.17,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,爆破
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:09.99,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.17,0:05:12.51,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你沒聽到我剛才說的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:14.77,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我覺得我解釋得很詳細了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:19.14,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你看 這麼脆弱 感覺隨時都會崩塌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:22.39,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,所以說 在崩塌前救出來就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:23.63,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:28.45,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,上鳴 如果在那裡不是假人 而是活人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.52,0:05:31.18,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,人家就在那邊求救 你要怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.53,0:05:33.12,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,因為辦不到 就此放棄嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:34.98,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這 這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:39.46,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,但是 現在又不是真人 只是訓練…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:43.35,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,應該不用勉強去救吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:45.79,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你自有勝算吧 爆豪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:46.74,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,當然有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.40,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,那就來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.67,0:05:50.79,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我們是為了成為英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:53.20,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,才加入雄英的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:54.90,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你說對吧 上鳴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:56.88,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,話是這麼說 沒時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:06:00.44,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,快開始吧 臭路人們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:02.94,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,至少告訴我有什麼計劃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:19.64,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,從那裡就能回到地上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.57,0:06:23.42,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,麗日同學 上去後立刻帶飯田同學去醫務室
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:27.23,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,蛙吹同學也跟著去 並且去向老師報告
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.46,0:06:29.29,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我回去放繩梯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:31.32,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,只有你們逃出來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.06,0:06:34.54,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,相澤老師
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:42.35,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,準備好了吧 路人們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.35,0:06:45.62,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,拜託了 可別打到我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:48.56,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,去死吧 AP射擊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:50.97,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,去吧 切島
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:57.99,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:07.13,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:13.20,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,徹底去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:19.40,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,什麼聲音 崩塌了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:24.18,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,不 不對 應該是樓下有人破壞了什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:26.36,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,難道是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:29.86,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這聲音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.59,0:07:31.60,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,是爆豪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:37.23,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,現在隨時都可能發生崩塌 這傢伙在想什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.93,0:07:39.65,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,爆破聲是從下面傳來的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:43.00,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,地下6層 最下層啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.49,0:07:46.00,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,偏偏是最脆弱的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.71,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,讓緊急用電恢復的人是爆豪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:52.99,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,而且還造成了這樣的爆破 難道說…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:58.12,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這種情況下他還在繼續救援訓練嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:00.28,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,轟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:08.57,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦 怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.81,0:08:11.44,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,都怪你在這種地方那樣搞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:12.23,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:15.06,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,別再拖拖拉拉了 快上去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:22.18,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,喂喂 這樣下去我們就要淹死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.47,0:08:24.47,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這下怎麼辦 爆豪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.47,0:08:32.56,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,“不會去救人”是什麼意思 相澤老師
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.94,0:08:35.60,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,難道說地下街的崩塌…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.88,0:08:37.45,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,是意料之中的意外
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.43,0:08:39.46,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我告訴你們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:42.24,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這點危機都無法解決的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.47,0:08:44.48,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,是不可能拿到臨時執照的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:46.81,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,可是 飯田同學都受傷了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:50.05,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,其他人可能也被困在地下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.31,0:08:54.70,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,那麼 他們就不再是英雄 是待救援者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.27,0:08:56.58,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,誰能去救他們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.73,0:08:58.20,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我去準備繩梯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:08:59.35,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:04.73,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,是不是做的太過火了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:07.97,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我做好了以防萬一的準備
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:14.16,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,常闇 用黑影破壞地板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:16.97,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,可是 這麼黑我無法控制
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:20.11,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,用我的火焰來壓制
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.55,0:09:21.27,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:22.82,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,黑影
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:28.18,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.81,0:09:32.49,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:37.07,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,在這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:38.61,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,上來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:40.04,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,轟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:42.31,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,誰要你幫忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.67,0:09:44.71,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這種情況下你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.77,0:09:48.81,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,就讓人家幫忙吧 接受轟的好意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.03,0:09:50.73,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,快點 抓緊時間
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:52.58,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,爆豪 走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:53.41,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,別拉我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:54.72,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:09:59.83,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:03.16,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,多謝了 轟 常闇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:04.66,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,沒事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:07.99,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,沒時間放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:10.64,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,地下水還沒有止住
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:13.05,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我來凍住水流
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.31,0:10:15.20,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這段時間你們快逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:17.69,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,轟 我也一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.69,0:10:21.11,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你們幾個的個性無法對付這種情況
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.82,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,靠太近還會被凍結波及
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.53,0:10:27.82,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,不想拖後腿就趕快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:29.53,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,轟說的沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:31.58,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,現在要爭取時間
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:32.81,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,趕快逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:34.26,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.58,0:10:36.24,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,耍什麼帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:37.80,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我在上面等你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:38.64,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.47,0:10:50.46,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這麼大的空間 不知道我能凍結到什麼程度
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.93,0:10:57.02,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,至少要爭取到 讓他們逃走的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:11.24,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事 溫度下降了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:14.70,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,是轟同學在用凍結嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:16.64,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,是為了控制住崩塌嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.29,0:11:19.55,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,總之 我要趕快下去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:23.03,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,只能使用強硬手段了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:30.27,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,綠谷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.51,0:11:33.43,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,切島同學 上鳴同學 常闇同學
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:35.80,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,太好了 你們平安無事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:37.47,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,嗯 你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.85,0:11:39.89,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,大家一直往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:43.07,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,在那座打開的電梯裡面有繩梯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:44.67,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這樣就能回到地面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.82,0:11:45.51,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.07,0:11:47.94,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我們得救了啊 切島
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:48.67,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:52.70,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,常闇同學 轟同學還在下面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.45,0:11:57.05,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,他在用凍結阻止地下水湧出
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:11:59.23,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,用凍結阻止地下水
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.71,0:12:00.87,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,還有...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:07.06,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,就差一點了 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:11.38,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,沒有繩梯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:12.32,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:13.53,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,切島同學
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.85,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,還有上鳴的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.47,0:12:19.35,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,切島同學 上鳴同學
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:21.48,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這個聲音是 麗日嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:26.07,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,對我現在放繩梯下去 你們再等等
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:27.43,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:30.41,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,做繩梯的是八百萬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:33.69,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你應該很累了 抱歉 拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.03,0:12:39.49,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,當 當然了 要繼續邁進
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:47.16,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,總算是阻止了地下水的上升了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:50.86,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,但比起這個 你為什麼還在這裡 爆豪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:53.00,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我不想欠你人情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:55.16,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,怎樣都好 快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:56.30,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,來不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:59.73,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,現在逃也沒用了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:04.19,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,就算轟同學的凍結再怎麼厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.77,0:13:09.09,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,也不可能凍住這麼一大片場地
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.13,0:13:15.02,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,應該只是凍住了水面幾公分 不 十幾公分的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:18.82,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,下面應該承受了流進來的地下水的壓力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:25.21,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這樣一來 被壓迫水 就會從牆壁的裂縫中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.37,0:13:28.49,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,像水箭一樣把磚塊炸開
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:32.96,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,最糟糕的情況 地下街可能會整個崩塌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:36.33,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,當然 我也已經預測到這種情況了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.43,0:13:37.78,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,少放馬後炮了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:39.96,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,但你還是留下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:44.33,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝留下來 是為了救助轟同學 而且...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:50.01,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝一定已經想好了逃離的對策
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:52.36,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝 你會怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:56.53,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你要怎麼救他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:14:00.30,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你已經想好了逃生方法了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.41,0:14:03.00,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,給我聽好了 半邊混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.62,0:14:06.93,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我現在爆破冰塊開個洞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:09.02,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,製造間歇泉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:11.91,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,水就會湧出
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:16.47,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,轟同學就順勢將水的表面凍結 製造立足點向上升
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:22.36,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我朝著上面 不斷爆破把天花板打穿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.95,0:14:26.22,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這樣就能一口氣到上面去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:28.21,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我理解你的逃生方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:33.95,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,但是你的爆破 能這麼精準打開讓水噴出來的洞嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.19,0:14:35.19,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,當然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.61,0:14:39.62,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,不 就算是小勝 成功機率也很低
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:45.24,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,但是 我的射門式就能打開所需的大小
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:48.89,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,發目同學製作的戰鬥服γ
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:53.79,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,只要靠它的耐久力 把ONE FOR ALL的比率提升到極限
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.59,0:14:58.07,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝 轟同學
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:14:59.16,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,綠谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.51,0:15:02.26,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你來幹什麼 臭呆子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:04.09,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我負責在冰上開洞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:05.04,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:07.57,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,轟同學 做好凍結準備
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:08.43,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:10.97,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝準備好爆破天花板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.02,0:15:13.27,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,別對我指手畫腳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:19.01,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,沒時間了 開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:23.56,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,ONE FOR ALL 全覆蓋 5%
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.37,0:15:28.27,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,爆碎風
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.13,0:15:36.38,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:40.92,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,下一波要來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.51,0:15:46.33,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:52.93,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,綠谷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:00.98,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,-上鳴同學 -上鳴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:03.22,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,常闇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:04.76,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,來這邊 上鳴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.83,0:16:09.73,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:10.64,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,抓緊時間
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:11.64,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:13.13,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,幹得漂亮 小梅雨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:21.15,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這裡是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:24.87,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,太好了 你醒了 飯田同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:28.19,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,八百萬同學 我到底是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:31.23,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,訓練中地下街發生崩塌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.17,0:16:33.63,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.84,0:16:35.79,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,那個時候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.57,0:16:41.83,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,是你把受傷的我送回來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:43.11,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:45.74,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,該道謝的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.16,0:16:48.44,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,謝謝你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:49.91,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,客氣什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:53.33,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,其他同學呢 在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:55.40,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:59.96,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,切島同學 上鳴同學 常闇同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:02.23,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,麗日同學 蛙吹同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:04.34,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,叫我小梅雨呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.01,0:17:07.35,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小梅雨同學 你們沒事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.23,0:17:12.05,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,綠谷同學 爆豪同學他們人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.35,0:17:18.11,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,是這樣的 最下層突然湧進了地下水
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:21.41,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,轟用凍結爭取了逃生時間
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.78,0:17:23.75,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,爆豪也留下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:28.28,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,綠谷知道後就去救他們了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.41,0:17:29.48,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:32.62,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,也就是說 他們三個都還在裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:35.93,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,一定不會有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:38.24,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,出久同學回去救人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:41.08,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,一定是有信心能成功
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.60,0:17:46.18,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,而且 爆豪同學和轟同學 也不會被這種小危機打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:49.61,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,所以 他們一定不會有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.68,0:17:51.80,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:56.15,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,好 在這裡的人一起成立救助小組吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:18:00.15,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,能拜託你們嗎 切島同學 麗日同學 小梅雨同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:00.81,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:02.42,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,一定救出他們
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:06.03,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,他們幾個一定在往上面走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.03,0:18:07.69,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,從地下二層開始找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.07,0:18:24.83,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,綠谷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:32.17,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,綠谷 振作點 綠谷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:39.53,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,轟同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.15,0:18:41.09,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,沒受傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:46.49,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,撞得全身都在痛 不過 還能動
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.15,0:18:48.54,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這裡是第幾層
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.03,0:18:51.80,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我們是在破壞3次天花板後掉下來的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:54.25,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,所以這裡應該是地下3層
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:57.72,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這樣啊 那爭取到不少距離了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:19:00.06,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這樣就能在地下水淹上來之前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:01.60,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,回到地面上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:05.36,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,都要感謝轟同學 還有小勝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:07.12,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:09.37,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:12.58,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:14.18,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,爆豪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.26,0:19:22.09,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:26.93,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝 振作點 小勝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:31.55,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,別在我耳邊哇哇叫 吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:33.20,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:35.99,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,爆豪 抓住我和綠谷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:37.43,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我們從這裡出去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:41.11,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這點小傷 不算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.63,0:19:42.64,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,別勉強了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.79,0:19:44.98,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我才不用你們幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:49.61,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝 沒時間了 抓住我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.64,0:19:50.57,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:51.88,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:55.32,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,就算勉強我也要做
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.89,0:19:58.62,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,這點事都要人幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:01.86,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,還怎麼成為No.1英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:03.82,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你都站不穩了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.12,0:20:06.17,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,只是扭到腳了而已
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:09.83,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝 抓著我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:11.20,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,放開我 臭久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.23,0:20:12.20,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:13.33,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:15.35,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我也想救你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.75,0:20:19.17,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,恢復備用電源的人是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.25,0:20:22.33,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,而且 還是為了讓大家方便逃生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.33,0:20:26.55,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,不對 我只是為了快點找到該死的待救援者而已
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:28.96,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,那為什麼要留到最後
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.51,0:20:31.90,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,因為你想救轟同學吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.24,0:20:33.30,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我不想欠人情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:35.85,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我被小勝救了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:38.39,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,嗯 我也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.73,0:20:42.04,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,所以 只是現在也好 讓我們幫忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:43.88,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:47.50,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.73,0:20:48.61,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,小勝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:56.45,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,當我的拐杖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.83,0:20:58.23,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.76,0:21:02.62,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,為了讓我能自己能走 當我的拐杖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:06.15,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,嗯 我會的 當你的拐杖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.19,0:21:07.67,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,拐杖就別說話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.67,0:21:09.38,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不說話了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:11.55,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你現在不就在說話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.72,0:21:16.49,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼 我聽不懂啦 臭呆子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:21.27,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,快到了 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.27,0:21:22.48,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:23.93,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,都叫你不准說話了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.02,0:21:25.85,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,找到他們了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:27.52,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.81,0:21:30.91,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,在臨時執照考試前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:34.58,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,我會在你們面前築起數道高牆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.24,0:21:38.87,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,跨越過去吧 勇往直前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:41.46,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,前往更遙遠的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:43.55,MHA.S04.DEFAULT,,0,0,0,,繼續邁進
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.89,0:22:08.85,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}從何時起我變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.85,0:22:13.90,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}越來越擅長忍耐了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:23.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}{\fad(0,350)}兒時還曾被說是愛哭鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.96,0:22:30.63,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}要保密哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.63,0:22:34.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}{\fad(0,350)}多麼殘酷的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.34,0:22:40.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}吶喊聲逐漸模糊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.97,0:22:46.64,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}與本應平淡無奇的未來漸行漸遠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.64,0:22:51.27,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}誰人都知曉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.27,0:22:57.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}我無法到達他身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.19,0:23:02.28,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}那要走到哪裡才好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.28,0:23:08.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}不知道答案 只能緊緊抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.37,0:23:11.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}那股能消除不安的憧憬
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.29,0:23:17.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fax-0.2}在心中不斷升溫 永不消逝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.55,0:23:19.30,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)\blur2\fax-0.2}我想改變
